    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: bbfc086f2785cbb2ec8165520feca2615d4a090a -->\nReady for the maintainer to merge.\n\nScope: one binary file changed, `assets/ui/tool-form-mill.png` (32x32 RGBA, 532 to 734 bytes). No code, no `crates/ui` change, no golden or post change. This is not a safety-tier change. No mutation was needed.\n\nWhat looks good:\n- The PNG is the output of `cargo xtask icons` from `assets/ui/svg/tool-form-mill.svg`. The source SVG is an original master in the repo.\n- The body has `Changelog: none` and `Fixes #3966`.\n- The change touches no snapshot PNG in `crates/ui/tests/snapshots`.\n- No screenshots are required: the PR changes only an icon asset, not `crates/ui` code. I viewed the new icon. It is a clean form-mill glyph.\n\nResults (locally, merged with upstream/main; the merge was \"Already up to date\", so the tree equals the PR head):\n- `cargo test -p xtask --bin xtask icons_tests`: 6 passed, 0 failed. This includes `committed_icon_pngs_match_their_svg_masters`, the test that was red.\n- Extra suites run: none owed. The diff has no `testdata/` file and no importer code.\n- Clippy: not run. No Rust file changed.\n\nRequested before merge: none.\n\nA maintainer will approve and merge by hand.\n",
